<title>FRANCE: EP confirms new committee heads.</title>
<headline>EP confirms new committee heads.</headline>
<dateline>STRASBOURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Parliament confirmed on Thursday night the names of the new chairpersons who will run its 23 specialist committees until the end of the legislature in June 1999.</p>
</text>
